        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;OPERATING STATUS — TABLE 85&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;−1 = Active / −5 = Inactive / +5 = Off&lt;br&gt;Default: −5" mermaidId="n:OPST" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="Operating status&#xa;Range: -1=Operating / -5=Not-Operating&#xa;Default: -5" id="3">
